  "verseCount": 18,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "20",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JER 20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jeremiah and Pashhur",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When the priest Pashhur son of Immer, the official in charge of the temple of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.20.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.20.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", heard Jeremiah prophesying these things,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he had Jeremiah the prophet beaten and put in the stocks at the Upper Gate of Benjamin at the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.20.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.20.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "'s temple.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The next day, when Pashhur released him from the stocks, Jeremiah said to him, \"The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.20.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.20.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "'s name for you is not Pashhur, but Terror on Every Side.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For this is what the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.20.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.20.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "says: 'I will make you a terror to yourself and to all your friends; with your own eyes you will see them fall by the sword of their enemies. I will give all Judah into the hands of the king of Babylon, who will carry them away to Babylon or put them to the sword.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will deliver all the wealth of this city into the hands of their enemies—all its products, all its valuables and all the treasures of the kings of Judah. They will take it away as plunder and carry it off to Babylon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And you, Pashhur, and all who live in your house will go into exile to Babylon. There you will die and be buried, you and all your friends to whom you have prophesied lies.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jeremiah's Complaint",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You deceived",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "me,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.20.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.20.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and I was deceived",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ";",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 20:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "you overpowered me and prevailed.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "JER 20:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "I am ridiculed all day long;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 20:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "everyone mocks me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Whenever I speak, I cry out",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 20:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "proclaiming violence and destruction.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "JER 20:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "So the word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.20.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.20.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "has brought me",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 20:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "insult and reproach all day long.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But if I say, \"I will not mention his word",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 20:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "or speak anymore in his name,\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "JER 20:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "his word is in my heart like a fire,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 20:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "a fire shut up in my bones.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "JER 20:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "I am weary of holding it in;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 20:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "indeed, I cannot.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I hear many whispering,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 20:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Terror on every side!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 20:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Denounce him! Let's denounce him!\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "JER 20:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "All my friends",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 20:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "are waiting for me to slip, saying,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "JER 20:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Perhaps he will be deceived;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 20:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "then we will prevail over him",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 20:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and take our revenge on him.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.20.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.20.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "is with me like a mighty warrior;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 20:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "so my persecutors will stumble and not prevail.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "JER 20:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "They will fail and be thoroughly disgraced;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 20:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "their dishonor will never be forgotten.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.20.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.20.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
